00:22:45,531 --> 00:22:50,252
[SPEAKER_04]: Then, a man comes along with an upper fire stick, thinking to light a fire and produce heat.

229
00:22:51,132 --> 00:22:52,833
[SPEAKER_04]: What do you think, Aggivessana?

230
00:22:53,113 --> 00:22:59,095
[SPEAKER_04]: By drilling the stick against that green sappy log lying in the water, could they light a fire and produce heat?

231
00:22:59,495 --> 00:23:00,395
[SPEAKER_04]: No, Master Gautama.

232
00:23:00,415 --> 00:23:00,795
[SPEAKER_04]: Why not?

233
00:23:01,355 --> 00:23:03,636
[SPEAKER_04]: Because it's a green sappy log and it's lying in the water.

234
00:23:03,796 --> 00:23:06,137
[SPEAKER_04]: That person will eventually get weary and frustrated.

235
00:23:06,817 --> 00:23:12,959
[SPEAKER_04]: In the same way, there are ascetics and brahmins who don't live withdrawn in body and mind from sensuality.

