273
00:26:49,540 --> 00:26:56,403
[SPEAKER_04]: And unless you reach that point, the Buddha is saying, you won't be able to give rise to knowledge and vision.

274
00:26:56,543 --> 00:27:04,106
[SPEAKER_04]: And that is the point where these people got, when the Buddha was teaching them the dhamma.

