00:27:05,327 --> 00:27:06,127
[SPEAKER_03]: Yes.

277
00:27:06,647 --> 00:27:08,368
[SPEAKER_04]: Like, in that span of time,

278
00:27:09,302 --> 00:27:28,942
[SPEAKER_04]: Because, obviously, it was the Buddha who was so skilled in teaching the dhamma, specifically according to people's dispositions, that he was able to bring them to a point where, at that time, not only bodily, verbally, mentally, but also on that internal level of their value, they had completely

