[SPEAKER_04]: So, yes, people would recognize to some extent, I can't be thinking sensual thoughts and engaging in sensuality and be meditating.

285
00:27:56,133 --> 00:28:07,302
[SPEAKER_04]: But they would try to basically compartmentalize the two, so that, you know, during their meditation, there can be no sensuality, but on the outside, there can be.

