00:30:26,051 --> 00:30:29,454
[SPEAKER_04]: You have no space to move forward, to move backward, to move left, to move right.

317
00:30:30,054 --> 00:30:33,117
[SPEAKER_04]: And that's when you will recognize, no, the problem was never

