00:31:00,740 --> 00:31:24,119
[SPEAKER_04]: The issue extends as far as, as it says there, you can experience the... Because, think about it, like, why is the Buddha saying ascetics and brahmins who would experience these acute, you know, pains of self-mortification, why do you think he would talk about that in relation to people who are not withdrawn from body and mind, from sensuality?

324
00:31:27,469 --> 00:31:30,591
[SPEAKER_01]: Just kind of put the other side of things into perspective.

