342
00:33:02,236 --> 00:33:02,977
[SPEAKER_04]: Exactly, yeah.

343
00:33:03,297 --> 00:33:07,879
[SPEAKER_04]: So, it's actually... it's not just back in the day, it's the same principle.

344
00:33:07,899 --> 00:33:08,099
[SPEAKER_04]: Yeah.

345
00:33:08,359 --> 00:33:08,860
[SPEAKER_02]: No matter

