00:33:09,500 --> 00:33:33,257
[SPEAKER_02]: It's the same like, you know, this New Year kind of resolutions people always like to do, and they last usually one or two months after New Year, because they feel guilty about, you know, how they live life through the whole year, you know, indulging in this or that, so they make this resolution, but yet there is no kind of that deep enough

347
00:33:36,882 --> 00:33:46,509
[SPEAKER_04]: So, it's like a cycle of over-indulging, over-compensating, over-indulging, over-compensating.

348
00:33:46,529 --> 00:33:48,311
[SPEAKER_03]: Yeah, and then the guilt becomes a hindrance.

